    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Golf Game Like No Other</h2>Welcome to the national amateur golf tournament at Oakvale Meadows!<br><br>Avoid the sand traps and water hazards, score birdies and eagles, make new friends, and win the day. Enjoy a golf experience where you not only need to aim your shots, but also keep your social relations finely tuned. Luckily everybody is well rested and in their best mood.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully featured course with 18 holes of varying difficulty!<br></li><li>Enjoy interacting with fellow golfers!<br></li><li>Drive golf carts if you're in a hurry!<br></li><li>Customise your golfer!<br></li><li>Chill and no-stress gameplay!</li></ul>",
